#!/usr/bin/env python3
# =============================================================
# Author:  TechOGR
# Repo:    https://github.com/TechOGR/bspwm_dotfiles_arch
#
# NetCenter - the network center of the rice, in the theme's style:
#   ✔ every interface (Ethernet, Wi-Fi, VPN, bridges...) with its state,
#     address and a live traffic trace
#   ✔ the selected one in detail: download / upload graph (60 s), rates,
#     totals, MAC, IPv4 / IPv6, gateway, DNS, MTU, link speed, driver
#   ✔ connect / disconnect it, autoconnect, IPv4 automatic (DHCP) or
#     manual (address, gateway, DNS), custom DNS over DHCP, MTU
#   ✔ Wi-Fi: scan, signal and security of each network, connect (with
#     password), forget, share a hotspot
#   ✔ saved connections: activate, deactivate, forget
#   ✔ networking, Wi-Fi and airplane mode switches, connectivity check
# Everything goes through NetworkManager (nmcli), in the background: the
# window never freezes. The frame of the window is the theme's
# (RoundBorders), the background its scene, the graph its colors.
#
# Usage: NetCenter   (a second launch closes it) - polybar network click
#
# Copyright (C) 2021-2026 TechOGR <https://github.com/TechOGR>
# Licensed under GPL-3.0 license
# =============================================================

